    <string name="vpn_disclosure_body">Hello Kitty VPN will create an encrypted, device-wide VPN tunnel and route non-local network traffic through the selected Hello Kitty VPN server while connected. Local, link-local and multicast networks always bypass the tunnel. If direct access to Russian sites is enabled in Settings, matching domains and IP addresses also bypass the VPN. Android will show a persistent VPN notification. The app calculates connection duration and traffic counters locally for status and does not inspect or collect your browsing content.</string>
